      "widgets_values": [
        "## Iris-3B: text to image\n\nPixel-space model, so there is no real VAE: **Load VAE \u2192 `pixel_space`**.\n\n- **Model**: `iris-3b_bf16` or `iris-3b_int8_convrot` from huggingface.co/nynxz/iris-3b (int8 is ~1.7x faster, needs an RTX 20-series or newer).\n- **Text encoder**: `qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors`, CLIP type **krea2**.\n- **Negative**: leave **empty**. The empty prompt is Iris's CFG null; don't use Conditioning Zero Out.\n- **Size**: ~1 megapixel, sides multiples of 16.\n- **Sampler**: euler / simple, 30-50 steps, CFG 3. Shift 4 (ModelSamplingSD3).\n"
      ]
    }
